LangName: 1033 "" "" "" "FB Agency FB Bold" "" "Version 1.01" "" "The Font Bureau, Inc." "The Font Bureau, Inc." "The Font Bureau, Inc." "ATF Agency Gothic was designed by M.F. Benton in 1932 as a single titling face. In 1990 David Berlow saw potential in the squared forms of the narrow, monotone capitals. He designed a lowercase and added a bold to produce Font Bureau Agency, an immediate popular hit. Sensing further possibilities, he worked with Tobias Frere-Jones and Jonathan Corum to expand Agency into a major series, offering five weights in five widths for text & display settings." "http://www.fontbureau.com" "http://www.fontbureau.com/designers"
